@@ -42,8 +42,29 @@
 //! ("the X and Z inputs call for orientation [1, 5, 6]") is
 //! reproduced for a cut needing the -X and +Z contacts.
 //!
+//! Blades (#641): a grooving/parting blade has no nose circle - its
